{"term": {"label": "義", "occurrences": 8, "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "4A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/li-lou-i", "title": "離婁上", "description": "孟子曰：「離婁之明，公輸子之巧，不以規矩，不能成方員：師曠之聰，不以六律，不能正五音；堯舜之道，不以仁政，不能平治天下。今有仁心仁聞而民不被其澤，不可法於後世者，不行先王之道也。\n「故曰，徒善不足以為政，徒法不能以自行。《詩》云：『不愆不忘，率由舊章。』遵先王之法而過者，未之有也。聖人既竭目力焉，繼之以規矩準繩，以為方"}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "事", "id": "事"}, {"form": "二", "id": "二"}, {"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "君", "id": "君"}, {"form": "實", "id": "實"}, {"form": "居", "id": "居"}, {"form": "弗", "id": "弗"}, {"form": "惡", "id": "惡"}, {"form": "正", "id": "正"}, {"form": "由", "id": "由"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "莫", "id": "莫"}, {"form": "言", "id": "言"}, {"form": "身", "id": "身"}], "edges": [{"weight": 0.7683706017975328, "source": "身", "target": "正"}, {"weight": 1.749199854809259, "source": "身", "target": "居"}, {"weight": 1.749199854809259, "source": "身", "target": "由"}, {"weight": 1.0560526742493137, "source": "身", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 1.0560526742493137, "source": "身", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 0.11778303565638346, "source": "正", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 1.461517782357478, "source": "正", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 2.1546649629174235, "source": "正", "target": "由"}, {"weight": 1.3814750746839417, "source": "正", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 1.461517782357478, "source": "正", "target": "莫"}, {"weight": 2.624668592163159, "source": "弗", "target": "居"}, {"weight": 1.2383742310432684, "source": "弗", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 1.7773707317759555, "source": "弗", "target": "二"}, {"weight": 2.1138429683971682, "source": "弗", "target": "實"}, {"weight": 1.2383742310432684, "source": "實", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 0.504405055963068, "source": "實", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.9315214116032138, "source": "實", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 2.8759830204440653, "source": "實", "target": "二"}, {"weight": 2.336986519711378, "source": "實", "target": "禮"}, {"w